  "reason": "Official documentation makes Live Football API a plausible low-cost Serie A candidate: 500 one-time free credits, a Serie A 2026/27 page, fixture/results endpoints, corners in match statistics, and yellow/red card event types. Terms permit use in own applications and redistribution to end users, but they do not expressly resolve internal ML feature/inference use, private raw retention, or upstream field rights. The live_match_details endpoint is described as real-time; access to complete post-match details for historical fixtures is not established. Its last_updated/stale fields do not establish upstream source-observation or correction time. No source-before-quote proof or complete 19-feature parity is available. Do not create an account, use credits, download data, infer, or evaluate until written clarification and a bounded source-only test are separately authorized.",
